# GCP-0057 (GKE node metadata exposure) on gke-cluster/gke-autopilot:
# false-positive on dead config. The default node pool is removed
# (remove_default_node_pool = true), and real nodes come from the gke-nodepool
# module which defaults workload_metadata_config mode = GKE_METADATA. The cluster
# node_config also sets GKE_METADATA when Workload Identity is enabled; Trivy
# can't evaluate the dynamic block statically.
AVD-GCP-0057
